 Fitch]]","value_text":"Dr. Benway\nRahmas\nMiss Fitch","links":[{"target_title":"Dr. Benway","label":"Dr. Benway","target_id":"huntik:page:9054","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Benway","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9054"},{"target_title":"Rahmas","label":"Rahmas","target_id":"huntik:page:14396","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rahmas","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A14396"},{"target_title":"Miss Fitch","label":"Miss Fitch","target_id":"huntik:page:26150","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Miss_Fitch","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26150"}]},{"name":"new titans","value_wikitext":"[[Cerberus]]","value_text":"Cerberus","links":[{"target_title":"Cerberus","label":"Cerberus","target_id":"huntik:page:4646","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cerberus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4646"}]}],"start":27,"end":414}],"sections":[{"heading":"Synopsis","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Zhalia]] leads the team on a quest to recover the amulet of [[Cerberus]]. With [[Dante]] missing, it's not long till they find themselves in a tough situation which leaves them with no choice but to form an uneasy alliance with the [[Seeker]], [[Rahmas]]. However, [[Dr. Benway]] has other plans, some which concern Dante.","text":"Zhalia leads the team on a quest to recover the amulet of Cerberus. With Dante missing, it's not long till they find themselves in a tough situation which leaves them with no choice but to form an uneasy alliance with the Seeker, Rahmas. However, Dr. Benway has other plans, some which concern Dante."},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Cerberus]], the titular Titan introduced in this comic, would go on to appear in [[Season 2]] of the ''Huntik'' television series, albeit with an overhauled design. \n[[Category:Comics| 14]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","text":"• Cerberus, the titular Titan introduced in this comic, would go on to appear in Season 2 of the Huntik television series, albeit with an overhauled design."}],"full_text":"Cerberus is the fourteenth issue of the Huntik Magazine comic book series.\n\nSynopsis\n\nZhalia leads the team on a quest to recover the amulet of Cerberus. With Dante missing, it's not long till they find themselves in a tough situation which leaves them with no choice but to form an uneasy alliance with the Seeker, Rahmas. However, Dr. Benway has other plans, some which concern Dante.\n\nTrivia\n\n• Cerberus, the titular Titan introduced in this comic, would go on to appear in Season 2 of the Huntik television series, albeit with an overhauled design.","raw_wikitext":"{{for|the Titan|Cerberus}}\n{{infobox comic\n| name           = \"''Cerberus''\"\n| image          = File:HM14 cover.jpeg\n| issue          = 14\n| released        = January 2011\n| previous       = [[The Secret of the Flying Dutchman]]\n| next           = [[The Titan of the Stage]]\n| director       = [[Iginio Straffi]]\n| new characters = [[Dr. Benway]]<br>[[Rahmas]]<br> [[Miss Fitch]]\n| new titans     = [[Cerberus]]\n}}\n'''Cerberus''' is the fourteenth issue of the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comic book series.\n== Synopsis ==\n[[Zhalia]] leads the team on a quest to recover the amulet of [[Cerberus]]. With [[Dante]] missing, it's not long till they find themselves in a tough situation which leaves them with no choice but to form an uneasy alliance with the [[Seeker]], [[Rahmas]]. However, [[Dr. Benway]] has other plans, some which concern Dante.\n\n== Trivia ==\n*[[Cerberus]], the titular Titan introduced in this comic, would go on to appear in [[Season 2]] of the ''Huntik'' television series, albeit with an overhauled design. \n[[Category:Comics| 14]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","categories":["Comics"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:12947","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Secret of the Flying Dutchman","label":"The Secret of the Flying Dutchman","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Secret_of_th